                "source": "UniProtKB",
                "id": "P02976"
              },
              {
                "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
                "source": "PubMed",
                "id": "24434550"
              }
            ],
            "value": "Released from the cell wall in a glycan-free form by LytM; released early in log growth, almost no release occurs after 3 hours growth (PubMed:24434550). Anchored to the cell wall by sortase A (By similarity)"
          }
        ]
      },
