          "value": "Host antibody-secreting cells proliferate in the bone marrow survival niches and sustain long-term antibody titers (PubMed:28031339). In addition, osteogenesis is not inhibited and normal expression of alkaline phosphatase, type I collagen, osteopontin and osteocalcin is observed (PubMed:22792377)"
